OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks company fined after
OL,4,Ablaze shut motorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pyrotechnics company that had no
OL,7,Flicence to store explosives that
OL,8,Fignited and caused a fire that shut
OL,9,Fpart of a motorway has been fined.
OL,11,FA barn and other containers used by
OL,12,FFireworks & FX Ltd (FFXAP LTD) were
OL,13,Fdestroyed in Welford, near Newbury,
OL,14,FBerkshire, when the blaze broke out
OL,15,Fthere on 16 April 2022.
OL,17,FSome debris from the fire was found on
OL,18,Fa bridlepath about 10m from the site
OL,19,Fand the M4, about 300m away, was closed
OL,20,Fbetween junctions 13 and 14 for about
OL,21,Ffour hours.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
