OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks company fined after
OL,4,Ablaze shut motorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company and its director Terence
OL,7,FHerbert, 69, of Binley, Hampshire, were
OL,8,Fboth fined at Reading Crown Court after
OL,9,Fthey both admitted two health and
OL,10,Fsafety breaches.
